Sure! Implementing a [SCIM](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7644) (System for Cross-domain Identity Management) server in PHP with [Slim Framework](https://www.slimframework.com/) as the router involves several steps. Below is a **basic guide** and **code outline** to get you started.

---

## 1. Project Setup

**Requirements:**
- PHP 7.4+
- Composer

```bash
composer require slim/slim "^4.0"
