## 8. References

- [SCIM RFC7644](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7644)
- [Slim Documentation](https://www.slimframework.com/docs/v4/)
- [SCIM Test Suite](https://github.com/indigo-dc/SCIM-SDK)

